    "cp": 1,
    "summary": "1 CP, in a Fight phase of either turn, right after an enemy unit picks its targets. Choose one NECRONS unit of yours that it picked as a target for at least one attack. For the rest of this phase, whenever one of that unit's models is destroyed before it has fought in this phase, roll a D6 (add 1 when the attacker is unravelling), and on a result of 4+ leave the model in place: it may fight once the attacking unit has completed its attacks, and only then is it removed.",
